* 27 Aug 26 Windows port - OPERATING-SYSTEM ACCESS, FOUR KEYWORDS OVER TWO FIELDS, NOT AN ABSOLUTE STATE: SH-OFF says nothing about OS.EXECUTE.
      case action = 'SH-ON'
         os.field = ACC$SH ; os.want = @true
