* 10 Nov 26 Windows port - from Linux 44807a43 (S.88 plan 2.9, D2): RECOVERY-ON / RECOVERY-OFF, whether the account's editors keep a recovery copy of unsaved
*   text (delivered off).  A user account only (os.set refuses any other with 12776).  Not loaded at sign-on: the editor reads the field each time it would
