* 15 Nov 26 Windows port - from Linux e080527e (S.242, RELEASE_1.1 299): XFER-ON / XFER-OFF, file transfer over the ssh login (delivered off).  A user account
*   only (os.set refuses any other with 15075).  The transfer server reads the field at each connection, so it takes effect at once.
      case action = 'XFER-ON'
