* 18 Oct 26 dm - S.65 write group (Linux 3fbfc0d): the same routine, the group sdfileswrite.
      case action = 'FILES-WRITE-ON'
         files.grp = 'sdfileswrite'
         files.want = @true
         gosub set.files
         return
      case action = 'FILES-WRITE-OFF'
         files.grp = 'sdfileswrite'
